<title>USA: Arthur Treachers to acquire franchisee.</title>
<headline>Arthur Treachers to acquire franchisee.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arthur Treacher's Inc said Wednesday it has signed a letter of intent to acquire M.I.E. Hospitality Inc, its largest franchisee.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed. The deal is expected to close by the end of November.</p>
<p>M.I.E. Hospitality owns and operates 32 franchised units Delaware, New Jersey, New York and Pennsylvania with annual restaurant sales in excess of $15 million.</p>
</text>
